# Flat inline forms (modern)

Flowbie forms are **flat**, **inline**, and **modern**. Labels live **inside** fields as placeholders, not stacked above inputs. Related fields group semantically with consistent colored backgrounds and rhythm.

## Mandatory self-check (form UI)

**Are labels inline placeholders on flat colored fields, with selects styled the same way?**

If not, restyle before shipping. Do not add stacked `<Label>` + `<Input>` rows unless the user explicitly asks.

## Inline labels (placeholders, not stacked)

### Do

- Use **`placeholder`** on `Input`, `Textarea`, and **`SelectValue placeholder`** on selects for field identity.
- One horizontal row per control cluster; **single-line** field height (`h-8` toolbar pattern or equivalent).
- Empty state reads the label from placeholder text; filled state shows value only.

### Do not

- Do **not** stack a visible label above the field (`<Label>` row then `<Input>` row) for standard forms.
- Do **not** use helper text under fields that restates the placeholder (see `copy-no-emdash-notifications.mdc`).
- Do **not** mix stacked labels and placeholder-only fields in the same form section.

**Accessibility:** use `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby` when placeholder alone is insufficient; keep visual label inline in the field.

## Flat forms with colored backgrounds

- Fields sit on **flat colored wells**, not bordered cards. No decorative borders.
- Default field surface: **`bg-zinc-900`** on black toolbars and form rows (see `BULK_HEADER_FIELD` in `bulk-workspace-header-styles.ts`).
- Use **surface color + spacing** to separate groups; not nested boxes or shadows.
- **`rounded-none`**, **`border-0`**, focus via ring only (`focus-visible:ring-2`).
- Placeholder text: **`placeholder:text-muted-foreground`**.

## Dropdowns and selects (stylized)

- Selects use the **same well styling** as text inputs (`BULK_HEADER_SELECT`, `BULK_HEADER_SELECT_TRIGGER`).
- **`SelectValue`** must set a **placeholder** that names the field (e.g. `placeholder="Reporting periods"`), not bare "Select".
- Selected value: full label visible (`[&>span]:line-clamp-none`, `whitespace-nowrap` on trigger).
- Chevron/icon: **`text-muted-foreground`**; trigger height matches inputs (`h-8`).

## Semantic grouping (forms)

- Group **related fields in one row or one tight block** (filters together, dates together, execution target together).
- Separate unrelated groups with **gap** or **`BULK_TOOLBAR_GROUP_DIVIDER`**, not extra wrappers.
- Form sections follow **Figma-optimized** rhythm: clear columns, fixed control widths where needed, no ornamental chrome.
- Dialog/side-panel forms: same inline placeholder pattern; group primary fields first, actions on one row.

## Workspace and plan alignment

- Toolbar forms: `bulk-workspace-header-styles.ts`, `generator-toolbar-theme.ts`.
- Task/workflow forms: match `AutomationTaskFlatRow`, `TaskExecutionTargetFields` placeholder patterns.
- Plans must call out form touchpoints in **Must-have strategies** per `plans-must-have-strategies.mdc`.

